 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2180  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:01:51Z (RFD66606-2180) 'Investigation (DETAILS.md): `gemma_cli_run` used prompt "Transcribe this audio verbatim" with `-n 200`. Gemma-4-12B heard the audio as spoken user input, reasoned about how to respond as an AI assistant, and expired the token budget inside chain-of-thought without reaching the final channel. Empty output.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2180  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-02T00:01:52Z (RFD66606-2180) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2180  1 LINE
 Text:Written
